OL,3,GNEWSARock stars gather on tiny Scottish
OL,4,Aisland for world stone skimming
OL,5,Achampionships
OL,6,
OL,7,FContenders from around the world are
OL,8,Fconverging on a tiny Scottish island
OL,9,Ffor one of the country's most unlikely
OL,10,Finternational sporting events - the
OL,11,Fworld stone skimming championships.
OL,13,FThe annual contest on the isle of
OL,14,FEasdale, in the Inner Hebrides, has
OL,15,Fattracted a record number of
OL,16,Finternational entries, representing
OL,17,Fmore than 30 nations, with some flying
OL,18,Fin from New Zealand and Canada.
OL,20,FLast year's competition was rocked by a
OL,21,Fcheating scandal after some contestants
OL,22,Fwere accused of stone tampering.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,427,420,260,160,0,100
