OL,3,GNEWSARock stars gather on tiny Scottish
OL,4,Aisland for world stone skimming
OL,5,Achampionships
OL,6,
OL,7,FToss Master Kyle Mathews, co-organiser
OL,8,Fof the event, said an official
OL,9,Ftournament geologist had been appointed
OL,10,Fthis year, leaving no stone unturned in
OL,11,Fkeeping the 400 challengers in order.
